PayVal		What you get if you're successful and you return to ReturnStel\
	0			No pay\
	1 and up		This number of credits\
	-10128 to -10255	Clean legal record with the govt with this ID\
	-20128 to -20255	Give the player an item with this ID\
	-30128 to -30255	Give the player an item with this ID at the start of the mission\
	-40001 to -40099	Take away this % of the player\'d5s cash (-40001 = 1%, -40002 = 2%, etc.)\
