	-4			ReturnStel's system\
	\cf2 -5			System adjacent to initial system\cf0 \
	-6			Whatever system the player is in (i.e. follow him around)\
	\cf2 128-1127		ID number of a specific system\cf0 \
	9999-10127		Specific govt's system\
	\cf2 15000-15127	Specific govt's ally's system\
\cf0 	20000-20127	System of any govt but this specific one\
	\cf2 25000-25127	Specific govt's enemy's system\cf0 \
\
ShipDude		What dude resource to use to determine the special ship's types and characteristics\
