CanAbort	\cf2 0\cf0 		Mission can\'d5t aborted, you must go to ReturnStel in order for it to "go away" and become inactive\
		\cf2 Nonzero\cf0 	Mission can be aborted at any time, by simply selecting another mission. Also, the mission "goes away" and becomes inactive at the moment it fails (e.g. you're scanned when you aren't supposed to be, etc.).\
