The next few fields tell Override about any auxiliary ships you want to be placed in the universe for this mission. Auxiliary ships cannot be given specific instructions, and no goals can be set for them; they simply are "normal" ships that are placed into the universe for the purpose of adding atmosphere to a mission.\
\
AuxShipCount	How many aux ships, if any, to activate for this mission:\
	-1		No aux ships\
	1-31		Place this many aux ships in the universe\
\
\cf2 AuxShipDude	ID number of the specific dude resource to use to set up the aux ships\cf0 \
\
AuxShipSyst		What systems to place the aux ships in:\
\cf2 	-1			Any system the player is in\cf0 \
	-2			TravelStel's system\
	\cf2 -3			ReturnStel's system\cf0 \
	128-1127		ID number of a specific system\
	\cf2 5000-5999		In this system, or any systems adjacent to it\cf0 \
	9999-10127		Any system belonging to this g\'9avt\
	\cf2 15000-15127	Any system belonging to this g\'9avt or its allies\cf0 \
	20000-20127	Any system not belonging to this g\'9avt\
	\cf2 25000-25127	Any system belonging to enemies of this g\'9avt\cf0 \
\
\
